Weddings & Events | events
<main id="main">
  <section class="events-band" style="min-height:min(86vh,820px)">
    <img src="img/event-table.jpg" alt="A long dinner table dressed with flowers and candles in the Vassaltis hall" width="2000" height="1334">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Weddings &amp; private events · Santorini &amp; Athens</p>
        <h1 class="d1" style="max-width:11em">Let’s celebrate.</h1>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;color:rgba(246,243,237,.88)">For any occasion that requires character, the choice is pretty obvious.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn light" href="#inquire">Start an inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="logos-row">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The setting</p>
          <h2 class="d3" style="margin-bottom:12px">A scenery second to none</h2>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">The landscape of Santorini is the lovechild of its volcano and the Aegean. Just follow the sea breeze and the tendrils’ spirals.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The table</p>
          <h2 class="d3" style="margin-bottom:12px">Every bite, every sip</h2>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">Refined cuisine and Vassaltis’ finest wines. When it comes to your event, every bite should be a mouthwatering memory.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The occasion</p>
          <h2 class="d3" style="margin-bottom:12px">One venue, every kind of gathering</h2>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">A wedding party, a bonding dinner or a corporate gathering, in a spacious hall with an unparalleled level of service.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom:clamp(72px,10vw,148px)">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:clamp(12px,2vw,24px)">
      <div class="frame" style="grid-column:1/span 7;aspect-ratio:3/2"><img src="img/event-dance.jpg" alt="Guests dancing in the hall at a Vassaltis wedding" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1335"></div>
      <div class="frame arch-sm" style="grid-column:8/span 5;aspect-ratio:3/4"><img src="img/wedding-bw.jpg" alt="A couple's first dance under string lights, in black and white" loading="lazy" width="1256" height="2000"></div>
      <div class="frame" style="grid-column:1/span 4;aspect-ratio:4/5"><img src="img/event-round.jpg" alt="Round tables set for a reception beneath the arched window" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="2000"></div>
      <div class="frame" style="grid-column:5/span 8;aspect-ratio:16/10"><img src="img/event-seaview.jpg" alt="A dressed table looking out over vines toward the sea" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1500"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap"><p class="cap">Capacities, packages and pricing are shared once we understand your date and group. <span class="confirm">Hall capacity to confirm</span></p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section paper" id="inquire" style="scroll-margin-top:80px">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,4fr) minmax(0,7fr);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,112px)">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start an inquiry</p>
        <h2 class="d2">Tell us about the day.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:22px 0 28px">A few details help the events team come back with the right questions, and the right date.</p>
        <p class="note-box">An inquiry doesn’t reserve a date. The team will reply by email to talk it through.</p>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:28px">Prefer to talk? <a href="tel:+302286022211">+30 22860 22211</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <form class="form" id="inq" novalidate>
          <fieldset class="field full">
            <legend>Type of event</legend>
            <div class="seg">
              <label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Wedding" required><span>Wedding</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Private celebration"><span>Private celebration</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Corporate dinner"><span>Corporate</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Other"><span>Something else</span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <fieldset class="field full">
            <legend>Where</legend>
            <div class="seg">
              <label><input type="radio" name="venue" value="santorini" checked><span>The winery, Santorini</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="venue" value="athens"><span>Vassaltis Downtown, Athens</span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-date">Preferred date</label><input id="f-date" name="date" type="date" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-guests">Approximate guests</label><input id="f-guests" name="guests" type="number" min="2" inputmode="numeric" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-name">Your name</label><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="f-email">Email</label><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="f-budget">Budget range <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <select id="f-budget" name="budget"><option value="">Prefer to discuss</option><option>Under €5,000</option><option>€5,000–€15,000</option><option>€15,000–€30,000</option><option>€30,000+</option></select></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="f-notes">Anything else <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label><textarea id="f-notes" name="notes" placeholder="Flexible dates, ceremony plans, dietary needs in the group…"></textarea></div>
          <label class="full" style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14px;align-items:flex-start"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy" required style="margin-top:4px;accent-color:var(--vine)"> <span>I agree that Vassaltis may use these details to reply to my inquiry, as described in the <a href="https://vassaltis.com/gdpr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a>.</span></label>
          <div class="full" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
            <span class="small muted">Concept: saved to the demo dashboard only, never emailed.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="full err" id="inq-err" role="alert" style="color:#8A2C2C;margin:0"></p>
        </form>
        <div class="success" id="inq-ok" hidden tabindex="-1">
          <p class="eyebrow">Inquiry received · concept</p>
          <h3 class="d3" style="margin-bottom:12px">Thank you, <span id="ok-name"></span>.</h3>
          <p style="margin:0 0 20px">In the live site, the events team would reply by email. Here, your inquiry was added to the sample staff dashboard as a new lead. Nothing was sent.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn" href="dashboard.html#events" id="ok-link">See it in the staff dashboard</a><button class="btn ghost" type="button" id="inq-again">Send another</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
